sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App (nc / curl / requests)
    participant F as Firewall / ACL
    participant H as Host 10.1.1.10
    Note over A,H: Case 1: host up, nothing listening on the port
    A->>H: SYN to :8443
    H-->>A: RST (port closed)
    Note left of A: instant "Connection refused"<br/>curl (7) · ConnectionRefusedError
    Note over A,H: Case 2: firewall silently drops
    A->>F: SYN to :830
    F--xA: dropped (no reply)
    A->>F: SYN retransmit
    F--xA: dropped
    Note left of A: waits, then "timed out"<br/>curl (28) · ConnectTimeout
    Note over A,H: Case 3: firewall rejects (sends RST / ICMP unreachable)
    A->>F: SYN to :22
    F-->>A: RST or ICMP admin-prohibited
    Note left of A: fast failure, looks like case 1
